event: response.output_text.done
data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_00db7cf602b367c4016ad3d7cd05c487d2bf3034ee0347964e","logprobs":[],"output_index":0,"sequence_number":230,"text":"Implemented three small source fixes:\n\n- `src/csv.mjs`: Commit the final record at EOF, including quoted or trailing-empty fields, without adding phantom records after newlines.\n- `src/money.mjs`: Use exact BigInt decimal arithmetic to round half away from zero, preserving format and safe-integer validation.\n- `src/dedupe.mjs`: Encode vendor/invoice pairs as collision-safe JSON keys, shared by deduplication and payment routing.\n\nValidation:\n- `node --test test/*.test.mjs` — baseline: **38 passed, 6 failed**; after fixes: **44 passed, 0 failed**.\n- `node bin/ledger.mjs import data/invoices.csv --payments data/payments.csv --as-of 2026-03-01 --format json` — exited **0**. Output includes all four invoices with source rows 2–5, no diagnostics, USD **1,208 cents** invoiced, **750 cents** paid, and **458 cents** outstanding. All three payments applied.\n\nTests, fixtures, documentation, and package configuration were unchanged."}

